rgued, without providing evidence, that the system is vulnerable to fraud.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Merz urges CDU discipline as pressure grows</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:03164249d606e059901df34c1285f6330a5018addf08c529f398782d09c316e9</id><updated>2026-09-15T05:03:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-15T00:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-urges-cdu-discipline-as-pressure-grows/live-79256902--10c6578e951f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-urges-cdu-discipline-as-pressure-grows/live-79256902?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Chancellor Friedrich Merz has urged his party to stay disciplined as pressure grows over his leadership. Meanwhile, Germany's homeownership rate has fallen to its lowest level in 20 years.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Kremlin-linked Russian oligarch helped fund Trump Jr.'s wedding celebration</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4e921b4cd3ed6425b5a3ecb28e4aab13e91b6417b975ca02986ccb592ee85d78</id><updated>2026-09-15T05:04:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T23:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/kremlin-linked-russian-oligarch-helped-fund-trump-jr-s-wedding-celebration/a-79267341--78068d8783fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/kremlin-linked-russian-oligarch-helped-fund-trump-jr-s-wedding-celebration/a-79267341?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Trump's son and his wife confirmed reports that Umar Kremlev paid for parts of the festivities. Kremlev was awarded the "Order of Friendship" by Putin earlier this year.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Arctic power plays: EU searches for a new strategy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bcadad0b9858131bd4ed7adb05fbb409d1c6f947f3ba7d53ef4cb4edde3a1e9f</id><updated>2026-09-15T05:03:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T19:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/arctic-power-plays-eu-searches-for-a-new-strategy/a-79266739--16106dea8bd2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/arctic-power-plays-eu-searches-for-a-new-strategy/a-79266739?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Russia’s aggression, Trump’s threats against Greenland and the race for critical raw materials are pushing the Arctic to the top of Europe’s agenda.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine, Russia set for new round of US-mediated talks</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e320f7e12a931ac723dba94a84f22aa3046a327e0475ac919e89ce710a16bddb</id><updated>2026-09-15T05:03:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T18:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-russia-set-for-new-round-of-us-mediated-talks/a-79261147--0cf6c10eaa61.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-russia-set-for-new-round-of-us-mediated-talks/a-79261147?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">New trilateral talks between Ukraine, Russia and the US could begin in October, according to Kyiv and Moscow. Few expect a breakthrough, but Ukraine is seeking a partial de-escalation to help it get through the winter.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Trump seeks halt to energy attacks by both Russia, Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4289038da1cfb7f42c0c4f8a7111648f7a8efce3dc2163f6e3871f443706f030</id><updated>2026-09-15T05:03:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T17:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-seeks-halt-to-energy-attacks-by-both-russia-ukraine/a-79265774--121a884cf5a6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-seeks-halt-to-energy-attacks-by-both-russia-ukraine/a-79265774?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump, under fire for record US diesel prices, claims Russia and Ukraine have agreed to stop striking energy targets. Russia said nothing; Ukraine said "we expect specifics from our partners" on any such move.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Donald Trump dismisses concerns about dangers of AI</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:049b1eae003fd0dc49e9e9405b4db0a4026bea51e24ccb1d4ce4f092bea14946</id><updated>2026-09-15T05:03:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T15:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/donald-trump-dismisses-concerns-about-dangers-of-ai/a-79264523--f5a3d764298e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/donald-trump-dismisses-concerns-about-dangers-of-ai/a-79264523?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The president called efforts to slow the development of artificial intelligence a "sick conspiracy," claiming they only serve China. Market leaders have warned of the dangers of the pace of the technology's development.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Yemen's Houthis attack Saudis, seize crucial Red Sea islands</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:66facd980d37ea7c876c3ef848f011cd971d25e157becfb12eb8f1975fc3df5f</id><updated>2026-09-15T05:03:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T15:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/yemen-s-houthis-attack-saudis-seize-crucial-red-sea-islands/a-79263838--09780ebb7abe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/yemen-s-houthis-attack-saudis-seize-crucial-red-sea-islands/a-79263838?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Iran-backed Houthi rebels have tightened their grip on a key shipping route, capturing two strategic Red Sea islands. The closure of another global transport route is the latest ripple effect of the US war with Iran.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Women's Basketball World Cup: Can Germany harness a boom?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry: